      }
    },
    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneI_3.5/p@41505",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CLEOPATRA.\nMy salad days,\nWhen I was green in judgment, cold in blood,\nTo say as I said then. But come, away,\nGet me ink and paper.\nHe shall have every day a several greeting,\nOr I’ll unpeople Egypt.",
